    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/appointment-management/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Appointment Management Theme is a flexible and professional solution designed to streamline online booking for various service-oriented businesses, such as beauty salons, medical clinics, dental offices, law firms, wellness centers, fitness studios, gyms, yoga classes, physiotherapy centers, barber shops, and even skateboarding coaching. It offers advanced scheduling features, including calendar synchronization, time slot selection, and recurring bookings, making it easy for clients to schedule and manage their appointments using intuitive booking forms, buttons, and widgets. Clients receive automated confirmations and reminders via SMS or email, and the theme integrates with platforms like Google Calendar, Outlook, WooCommerce, PayPal, and Stripe for secure payment management. With a clean, mobile-responsive design, clients can book appointments from any device, while staff can manage team availability and track client records through a user-friendly dashboard. Focused on boosting conversions and user interaction, this theme also provides personalized booking pages, service listings, testimonials, and customizable workflows. Fully compatible with the Bookly plugin, it’s an excellent option for salons, clinics, fitness studios, and coaches in the skateboarding industry looking to enhance their scheduling processes and improve client experiences. You can explore its features at https://demo.asterthemes.com/appointment-management/."
    },
